## The Total Ring Number: How to Budget Before You Browse

**The Total Ring Number** is the stone price plus the setting price. It is the only number that matters when you are setting a budget.

Most buyers calculate the stone budget and forget the setting. A [$1,190 Art Deco setting](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/art-deco-inspired-fleur-de-lis-pave-vintage-style-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-315298?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) changes your total by $1,190. At these price points, that is not an afterthought.

